{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260529_171303_p1_b14", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "1. 当用户提出售后担忧时，先确认痛点，然后立即用产品价值（如MatePad的NearLink优势）转移焦点，避免陷入单一话题循环。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260529_172512"}
